 Protein is a high biological value protein supplement that can be mixed with various liquids for easy consumption.", "RESOURCE ARGINAID:Resource ArginAid is a nutritional supplement that contains L-arginine, specifically formulated to be diluted in liquids for consumption. It is designed to deliver arginine, which supports the dietary needs of patients.", "SCANDISHAKE:ScandiShake is a high-calorie nutritional supplement that can be mixed with milk to enhance caloric intake.", "NUTRICIONES PARENTERALES ADULTOS:Nutritional protocols for adult patients in the hospital, established in March 2014, focusing on parenteral nutrition.", "MÓDULOS:Modules refer to specific nutritional supplements that can be added to enhance dietary intake, including protein, arginine, caloric, and thickening agents.", "PROTEICO:Resource Instant Protein is a high-protein supplement that can be mixed with various liquids to provide additional protein intake.", "CALÓRICO:ScandiShake is a caloric supplement designed to provide high energy intake when mixed with milk.", "FÓRMULAS POLIMÉRICAS HIPERCALÓRICAS:", "ABBOTT NUTRITION:Abbott Nutrition is a company that specializes in nutritional products and solutions for various health needs.", "BAXTER:Baxter is a global healthcare company recognized for its extensive range of medical products and services. The company has conducted studies focusing on patients receiving Nutritional Parenteral Delivery (NPD), emphasizing various psychosocial aspects and quality of life. As a manufacturer, Baxter is known for producing nutritional solutions, including nitrogenous and lipid solutions specifically designed for parenteral nutrition. Additionally, Baxter has engaged in research that reviews the quality of life of adult patients who are treated with long-term parenteral nutrition, further highlighting its commitment to improving patient outcomes in the healthcare sector.", "B|BRAUN:B|BRAUN is a company that shares expertise in medical technology and healthcare solutions.", "NESTLÉ HEALTH SCIENCE:Nestlé Health Science is dedicated to nourishing personal health through nutritional science.", "OLICLINOMEL N4-550 2L:Oliclinomel N4-550 2L is a parenteral nutrition solution designed for patients requiring nutritional support."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}